msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Merekod tontonan anda dalam Kodi dan menyegerak pustaka anda dengan Trakt"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Trakt Relay merekod ke Trakt cereka, episod, TV langsung dan rakaman yang anda tonton dalam Kodi, dan menyegerak pustaka anda dengannya: koleksi, status tontonan, penarafan dan kemajuan main balik, setiap arah didayakan dalam tetapan. Ia meminta penarafan selepas anda menonton, dan menu konteksnya boleh memberi penarafan, menambah ke senarai tontonan dan memulakan tonton semula sesebuah rancangan. Rekod tontonan yang gagal akan dicuba semula kemudian.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay ialah versi ubah suai script.trakt oleh Trakt.tv, Razzeee dan para penyumbangnya."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Trakt Relay tidak bergabung dengan atau disokong oleh Trakt."

