msgstr "Sedang ditonton"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Tambahan Trakt juga didayakan. Kedua-dua tambahan merekod tontonan dan menyegerak dengan Trakt, jadi semuanya dilakukan dua kali."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Kekalkan kedua-duanya"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Mulakan tonton semula"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Mulakan tonton semula di Trakt? Kemajuan anda bermula semula, dan setiap episod ditanda belum ditonton dalam Kodi."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Tonton semula dimulakan"

msgctxt "#32223"
