msgstr "Tidak dapat memulakan tonton semula"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Guna tema OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Menunjukkan logo merah Trakt, ikon hati dan warna serlahan, seperti di og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "%i item tidak dapat disegerak"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Akaun Trakt anda dikunci. Hubungi sokongan Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Had senarai tontonan %i telah dicapai"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Pilih apa yang hendak disegerak"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Membuka persediaan segerak yang ditunjukkan selepas bersambung ke Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Menyegerak apabila Kodi selesai mengimbas atau membersihkan pustaka. Jika tidak, segerak hanya berjalan apabila anda memulakannya, seperti dari menu konteks."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Memberitahu apabila segerak selepas imbasan atau pembersihan pustaka bermula dan selesai."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Tidak menunjukkan pemberitahuan segerak semasa video dimainkan."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Memadankan item tanpa ID IMDb, TMDB atau TVDB melalui tajuk dan tahun, semasa merekod tontonan dan menyegerak. Tidak sekali-kali digunakan untuk menanda item sebagai belum ditonton atau membuang penarafan."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Status tontonan"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Trakt ke Kodi: Kodi mengikut Trakt, termasuk kiraan main dan tarikh, dan apa-apa yang tidak pernah dimainkan di Trakt ditanda belum ditonton. Kodi ke Trakt: item yang ditonton dalam Kodi tetapi tidak pernah dimainkan di Trakt ditambah ke sejarahnya. Dua hala: setiap pihak menerima rekod main yang tiada padanya, dan tiada apa-apa ditanda belum ditonton di luar tonton semula Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mati"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Trakt ke Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Kodi ke Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "Dua hala"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Penarafan"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Cereka, rancangan dan episod"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Trakt ke Kodi: Kodi mengikut Trakt, dan penarafan yang tiada di Trakt dibuang dalam Kodi. Kodi ke Trakt: penarafan Kodi ditambah ke Trakt, menggantikan penarafan yang berbeza. Dua hala: penarafan yang tiada disalin ke kedua-dua arah, dan jika berbeza, penarafan Trakt dikekalkan."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Titik sambung semula dari Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Kodi menyambung semula di tempat item dijeda di Trakt, seperti dari peranti lain. Main balik dalam Kodi masih menghantar kemajuannya ke Trakt apabila ini dimatikan."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Penambahan"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Penambahan dan pembuangan"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Penambahan: item Kodi ditambah ke koleksi Trakt. Penambahan dan pembuangan: item koleksi yang tiada dalam Kodi turut dibuang daripadanya, termasuk item dari peranti atau aplikasi lain."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Relay sentiasa merekod tontonan apabila bersambung. Segerak mengendalikan yang tidak direkod: peranti lain, sejarah lama."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Hidup"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Status tontonan tidak disegerak."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Kodi mengikut Trakt, termasuk kiraan main dan tarikh. Apa-apa yang tidak pernah dimainkan di Trakt ditanda belum ditonton dalam Kodi."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Item yang ditonton dalam Kodi tetapi tidak pernah dimainkan di Trakt ditambah ke sejarahnya. Kodi tidak diubah."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Setiap pihak menerima rekod main yang tiada padanya, dan tiada apa-apa ditanda belum ditonton di luar tonton semula Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Penarafan tidak disegerak."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Penarafan Kodi mengikut Trakt, dan penarafan yang tiada di Trakt dibuang dalam Kodi."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Penarafan Kodi ditambah ke Trakt, menggantikan penarafan yang berbeza. Kodi tidak diubah."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Penarafan yang tiada disalin ke kedua-dua arah. Jika berbeza, penarafan Trakt dikekalkan."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Kodi mengekalkan titik sambung semulanya sendiri."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Kodi menyambung semula di tempat item dijeda di Trakt, seperti dari peranti lain."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Segerak hanya berjalan apabila anda memulakannya, seperti dari menu konteks."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Menyegerak apabila Kodi selesai mengimbas atau membersihkan pustaka."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Simpan dan segerak"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i items in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Tanda %i item sebagai belum ditonton dalam Kodi agar sepadan dengan Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Buang %i penarafan dalam Kodi agar sepadan dengan Trakt?"
